src/play/accounts.ts (control interface /api/accounts and /api/login: the account page of the desktop UI)
  Adapted from OpenMausBot, Copyright 2026 Milind Soni and OpenMausBot contributors,
  https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot (commit 9649348, 2026-11-03), Apache License 2.0; see
  app/third-party/OpenMausBot-LICENSE. Taken from server/drivers/claude-auth-status.ts (`claude auth status --json`),
